==Battleground==
*2 [[Loris|Lorises]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 80~86.67 seconds<sup>2,400f~2,600f</sup>.
*1 [[Othom]] spawns as the boss after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*6 [[Sir Rel]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Sir Rel]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*7 [[Sir Rel]]s spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 36.67~43.33 seconds<sup>1,100f~1,300f</sup>.
*4 [[Sir Rel]]s spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Since the Sir Rels are the main pushing power of this stage, it is advised that you use either powerful area attackers such as [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]] and [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] or good anti-Relic units like [[Figure Skating Cats (Super Rare Cat)|Slapsticks]] to deal with the swarms of Sir Rels. If dealt with correctly, the Lorises and Othom won't be much of an issue.

